<section><h2>1 · Load observations</h2><div class="grid two"><label>Data file<input id="file" type="file" accept=".csv,.dat,.txt,.out"></label><label>File format<select id="format"><option value="csv">CSV with header · UTF-8</option><option value="geo">GEO-EAS · whitespace</option></select></label></div><button id="demo" class="secondary">Load teaching example</button><button id="example" class="secondary">Download example CSV</button><p id="dataInfo" class="small">Data stay in your browser. No server or external libraries are required.</p><div class="grid"><label>X coordinate<select id="xf"><option value="">Choose field</option></select></label><label>Y coordinate<select id="yf"><option value="">Choose field</option></select></label><label>Z coordinate · optional<select id="zf"><option value="">Choose field</option></select></label><label>Variable<select id="vf"><option value="">Choose field</option></select></label><label>Secondary variable · optional<select id="ef"><option value="">Choose field</option></select></label></div><div class="grid two"><label>Trim minimum · inclusive<input id="tmin" type="number" value="-1e21" step="any"></label><label>Trim maximum · exclusive<input id="tmax" type="number" value="1e21" step="any"></label><label>CRS / verified coordinate description<input id="crs" type="text" value="Local coordinates · meters" step="any"></label><label>Distance units<input id="units" type="text" value="m" step="any"></label></div><p class="small">Use linear coordinates in one verified coordinate system. All ranges, grid spacing, and search radii use those same units. No coordinate conversion is performed.</p><details><summary>CSV and GEO-EAS examples</summary><p class="small">CSV: column names across row 1; one observation per subsequent row.</p><pre>X,Y,Yield
